A||||17||GT Bastard||Finally, I got myself a FUN job!||||14||
Z||000000||GT Bastard||10-12-2000||10:14 PM||||I was job hunting for a PC job when I realized that PC's make me sick(mental scars from previous job.)  Then I spotted a car detailing position in the paper so I went for it.  A friend of mine did it for a couple years and loved it, so I figured it would be a change of pace.  I applied and began harrassing them a couple days and got the job. I'm getting training to run the detailing department for Saturn.  It's a pretty decent sized dealer, and I get to work in a big, clean, well-equipped shop!  Best of all, It's almost all mine.  It's pretty cool.  I get to drive all kinds of cars around and make them pretty.  I work at my own pace and listen to music, and the only tricky part is learning the different chemicals.  Best of all, I don't have to deal with whining customers.  So anyhow, I excited to finally get a paycheck so that I can finish my motor and buy all the crazy sh*t I want for the Fiero.  I highly recommend this job if you like being around cars.  ||||reg||14
Z||000001||gixxer||10-12-2000||11:10 PM||||Good Lord! Sounds like HONEST work. I haven't done any of that since I serviced air-conditioning and furnaces. Glad you like your job!<BR>Brian||||reg||1
